<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22673" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>weeping, wailing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχέθε δ᾽ ὄσσε γόοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.758
				</span></i>
			; also of <i>louder signs of grief</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				103
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρικλάγκταν γόον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					12.21
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρίδακρυς γ., πολύδακρυς
			γ.</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				949
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				449
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόους δακρύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					579
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκτρᾶς γ. ὄρνιθος</span>, of
			the nightingale, ib.<i><span class="en">
				629
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. τινός</span>
			<i>grief for</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				3.644
			</span></i>; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόους πρὸς αὐτὴν [τούτων]
				θησόμεσθ᾽, ἃ πάσχομεν</span>
			<i>for</i> our sufferings, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1121
			</span></i>: in late Prose, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ma.</u>
				1.18
			</span></i> (pl.), al.</div>
